  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759767,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1500 DS Spirits Vol. 5: Hanafuda - Description\n\nStep into the vibrant world of traditional Japanese card games with *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 5: Hanafuda* for the Nintendo DS! This title brings the classic Hanafuda card game to life with a charming aesthetic and engaging gameplay. Hanafuda, meaning \"flower cards,\" features a unique deck of 48 cards, each depicting beautiful illustrations of flowers and seasonal imagery.\n\nThe game offers a variety of ways to experience Hanafuda, from learning the basic rules with a comprehensive tutorial to challenging yourself against the AI in single-player mode.  Discover the intricacies of scoring and strategic card combinations as you strive to outwit your opponents.  Beyond the core gameplay, *1500 DS Spirits Vol. 5* includes a gallery of stunning Hanafuda card artwork, providing a deeper appreciation for the artistry and cultural significance of this beloved pastime. Whether you're a seasoned card player or a curious newcomer, this title provides an accessible and enjoyable introduction to the world of Hanafuda."
    },
